# Terminology (Mezastar)

Use the correct domain terms in ALL user-facing copy and ALL new identifiers:

- **tag** / **Meza Tag** — never "card"
- **Grade** (1–6) — never "rarity". Grade 5 = Star, Grade 6 = Superstar
- **Energy** (寶可能量) — the power number on a tag; never "level"
- **Lanes** — the 3 arcade slots; battles are 3v3
- **Get Gauge** — the catch meter
- **Memory Tag** — red progress-tracking tag (non-standard type)
- **Special Tag Battle** — co-op dual-screen mode

The seed dataset (community prototype) uses card/star/rarity internally. When migrating,
field-name churn can be deferred if risky, but new code and all UI text must use the terms above.
Account for non-standard tag types (Memory/Special), not only standard Pokémon tags.
